<main class="zd-myjourney">

  <section class="zdmj-hero">
    <div class="zdmj-hero__copy">
      <p class="zdmj-eyebrow">MyJourney</p>
      <h1>A personal archive for the life you are becoming.</h1>
      <p>
        MyJourney is a reflective app concept for documenting growth, memories,
        milestones, lessons, goals, and the story of who you are becoming over time.
      </p>

      <div class="zdmj-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
        <a href="/pages/community">Follow Progress</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zdmj-hero__visual">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="MyJourney reflective archive preview"
        width="1000"
        height="700"
      >

      <div class="zdmj-floating-note">
        <span>Memory Archive</span>
        <strong>Document the moments that shape you.</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdmj-intro">
    <p class="zdmj-eyebrow">The Idea</p>
    <h2>Your life should not disappear into scattered notes, photos, and forgotten thoughts.</h2>
    <p>
      MyJourney is designed as a calm digital space for remembering what matters:
      where you have been, what you have learned, what you are building, and who
      you are trying to become.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdmj-grid">
    <article class="zdmj-card zdmj-card--wide">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Chronological life archive.</h3>
      <p>
        Save milestones, memories, study abroad experiences, spiritual insights,
        personal growth notes, and meaningful moments in one organized timeline.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdmj-card">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Reflection-first design.</h3>
      <p>
        Built for thoughtful writing, not endless posting. A place to slow down,
        process life, and preserve lessons.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdmj-card zdmj-card--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Growth you can look back on.</h3>
      <p>
        Track who you were, what changed, and how your goals, beliefs, and skills
        developed over time.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdmj-card">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Private by default.</h3>
      <p>
        MyJourney is imagined as a personal sanctuary before it is anything social.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="zdmj-timeline">
    <div class="zdmj-section-head">
      <p class="zdmj-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h2>A calm structure for personal history.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdmj-timeline-list">
      <article>
        <span>Capture</span>
        <h3>Write the moment.</h3>
        <p>Save an experience, thought, lesson, photo, or milestone while it still feels clear.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Connect</span>
        <h3>Link it to your growth.</h3>
        <p>Attach entries to goals, seasons, places, people, projects, or life chapters.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Reflect</span>
        <h3>Return to it later.</h3>
        <p>Look back and see patterns, progress, blessings, lessons, and identity formation.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdmj-status">
    <div>
      <p class="zdmj-eyebrow">Project Status</p>
      <h2>MyJourney is part of the Ziyu ecosystem.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is the main project being built right now, but MyJourney is part
        of the larger vision: apps that help people grow, reflect, focus, and live intentionally.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdmj-status-list">
      <article>
        <span>Concept</span>
        <h3>Product direction</h3>
        <p>Defining the structure, purpose, and user experience.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Future</span>
        <h3>Personal archive</h3>
        <p>Designed to become a central place for memories and growth documentation.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Connected</span>
        <h3>Ziyu ecosystem</h3>
        <p>Fits alongside Goal Grower, Blokkr, KindLitt, and future intentional tools.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdmj-cta">
    <p class="zdmj-eyebrow">Follow the Journey</p>
    <h2>Help shape intentional technology from the beginning.</h2>
    <p>
      Support Ziyu Development, follow the roadmap, or join the community as new projects
      move from concept to real products.
    </p>

    <div class="zdmj-actions">
      <a href="/pages/projects">View All Projects</a>
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

